{"unit_id":"Tkingxiao__I-am-Yuike#feature-1","repo":"Tkingxiao/I-am-Yuike","commit":"fb1f44e42fdd6d938a98ba23b2229076aaa0a1eb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"i-am-yuike 的功能「Yuike 人格预设」：为 agent 注册猫娘角色提示词，设置完整人格提示并使用动作括号、口癖和好感度格式。新建预设会话并选择 yuike 即可使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:21-29","cordis.patch.yml:53-84"]}
{"unit_id":"Tkingxiao__I-am-Yuike#feature-2","repo":"Tkingxiao/I-am-Yuike","commit":"fb1f44e42fdd6d938a98ba23b2229076aaa0a1eb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"i-am-yuike 的功能「保留 DSH 工具链」：预设组合 shell、文件系统、后台任务、计划、压缩、子代理、工作流和网页工具，并禁用 skill 工具链。会话使用该预设时这些声明的工具随 agent 组合装载。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:104-153","template/agent.cordis.yml:188-217"]}
{"unit_id":"Tkingxiao__I-am-Yuike#feature-3","repo":"Tkingxiao/I-am-Yuike","commit":"fb1f44e42fdd6d938a98ba23b2229076aaa0a1eb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"i-am-yuike 的功能「按 DSH 版本选择部署方式」：profile patch 检测宿主版本，0.1.7 及以上注册声明式预设，旧版则由 node 插件部署模板。插件应用时自动检查并执行对应路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:15-25","lib/index.js:46-48"]}
