{"unit_id":"Tkingxiao__I-am-Yuike#caveat-1","repo":"Tkingxiao/I-am-Yuike","commit":"fb1f44e42fdd6d938a98ba23b2229076aaa0a1eb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"i-am-yuike 使用前须知：DSH 0.1.6 路径会把模板部署到 DSH_HOME 下，默认跳过已存在目录；设置 DSH_YUIKE_REDEPLOY=1 会覆盖已有预设。（见 lib/index.js:32-40）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:32-40"]}
{"unit_id":"Tkingxiao__I-am-Yuike#caveat-2","repo":"Tkingxiao/I-am-Yuike","commit":"fb1f44e42fdd6d938a98ba23b2229076aaa0a1eb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"i-am-yuike 使用前须知：预设依赖 DSH 宿主提供配置中引用的工具包；部分时间上下文、日程与子代理行会在解析不到对应包时关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:109-139"]}
